# Loge: DIMACS smoke test

```elixir
root = Path.expand("..", __DIR__)

Mix.install([
  {:loge, path: Path.join(root, "loge"), override: true},
  {:loge_dimacs, path: Path.join(root, "loge_dimacs")},
  {:kino_loge, path: Path.join(root, "kino_loge")}
])
```

## Solving

Expected: **Satisfiable**, one model, `1 -2 3`.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJjbGluZ28iLCJsYW5ndWFnZSI6ImRpbWFjcyIsIm9wdGlvbnMiOnsibW9kZWxzIjoxfSwic291cmNlIjoiYyB4MSwgbm90IHgyLCB4MiBvciB4M1xucCBjbmYgMyAzXG4xIDBcbi0yIDBcbjIgMyAwXG4iLCJ2YXJpYWJsZSI6IiJ9","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Dimacs.Engines.Clingo, "c x1, not x2, x2 or x3\np cnf 3 3\n1 0\n-2 0\n2 3 0\n",
  models: 1
)
```

Models `0` enumerates all of them. Expected: **Satisfiable**, three models.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJjbGluZ28iLCJsYW5ndWFnZSI6ImRpbWFjcyIsIm9wdGlvbnMiOnsibW9kZWxzIjowfSwic291cmNlIjoicCBjbmYgMiAxXG4xIDIgMFxuIiwidmFyaWFibGUiOiIifQ","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Dimacs.Engines.Clingo, "p cnf 2 1\n1 2 0\n", models: 0)
```

Expected: **Unsatisfiable**, no models.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJjbGluZ28iLCJsYW5ndWFnZSI6ImRpbWFjcyIsIm9wdGlvbnMiOnsibW9kZWxzIjoxfSwic291cmNlIjoicCBjbmYgMSAyXG4xIDBcbi0xIDBcbiIsInZhcmlhYmxlIjoiIn0","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Dimacs.Engines.Clingo, "p cnf 1 2\n1 0\n-1 0\n", models: 1)
```

## Linting

Expected: under the editor, variable 4 exceeds the header and the clause count
differs from it; evaluating raises `Loge.Error` with both findings.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJjbGluZ28iLCJsYW5ndWFnZSI6ImRpbWFjcyIsIm9wdGlvbnMiOnsibW9kZWxzIjoxfSwic291cmNlIjoicCBjbmYgMyAzXG4xIC00IDBcbjIgMFxuIiwidmFyaWFibGUiOiIifQ","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Dimacs.Engines.Clingo, "p cnf 3 3\n1 -4 0\n2 0\n", models: 1)
```

